                                                "sense_id": "c406e5a5-49fc-3865-9edb-f0dcc550bf0f",
                                                "text": "Japanese troops were pulled to Yuehyang, at the junction of the Hsiang and Yangtze rivers, from Hunan, Honan, and Hupeh provinces."
