                                                "sense_id": "c406e5a5-49fc-3865-9edb-f0dcc550bf0f",
                                                "text": "In his capacity as Thief-punishing General, after the grand birthday celebrations in Hankow, he transferred his headquarters to Yüeh-yang."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "52fcb1c9-73a6-3059-bace-956b9f5c86d1",
